{"seq":2,"slug":"sponsored-blending","title":"广告与赞助商品和自然结果的混排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/campaign-injection/sponsored-blending","wordCount":2793,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"广告与赞助商品和自然结果的混排\">广告与赞助商品和自然结果的混排</h1><p>搜索结果的头部位置天然稀缺，而它恰好可以被出售。赞助商品（sponsored products）混排要做的事，是在自然结果的序列里插入竞价商品并决定它们的位置，同时不破坏用户对「搜索有用」的信任。这件事的核心难点不在于竞价本身，而在于<strong>定价与相关性之间的耦合</strong>：出价高的商品往往相关性不高，把它们放太靠前会伤害长期流量价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-广告位的经济学约束\">核心概念：广告位的经济学约束</h2><p>广告混排的最优位置不是「谁出价高谁最前」，而是让<strong>每次展示的长期价值最大化</strong>。这里有两股力量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>短期收益</strong>：广告收入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>bid</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>pCTR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{eCPM} = \\text{bid} \\times \\text{pCTR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pCTR</span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 bid 是广告主出价，pCTR 是预估点击率。</li>\n<li><strong>长期价值</strong>：相关性高的广告点击后转化更好，用户不会因为看到广告而降低对搜索的信任；相关性低的广告即使被点击，也会造成次会话流失。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把它们写成一个排序目标（质量加权出价）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>rank</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>bid</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>pCTR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>quality</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>κ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rank}(a) = \\text{bid}(a) \\times \\text{pCTR}(a \\mid q, u) \\times \\text{quality}(a, q)^{\\,\\kappa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bid</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pCTR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quality</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">κ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 是质量项的指数，通常取 0 到 1 之间的小数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 退化成纯竞价（谁出价高谁赢），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越偏向相关性。搜索广告的主流实践是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa \\in [0.3, 0.7]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，Google Ads 的 Quality Score 与 Amazon 的广告相关性打分体系都属于这个思路的工程化实现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[查询 + 用户] --&gt; A[广告候选集]&#10;    A --&gt; B[pCTR 预估]&#10;    A --&gt; C[相关性质量分]&#10;    A --&gt; D[出价]&#10;    B --&gt; E[质量加权出价 rank]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[广告位分配与挤压约束]&#10;    F --&gt; G[与自然结果混排]&#10;    G --&gt; H[最终列表]\">graph TD\n    Q[查询 + 用户] --&gt; A[广告候选集]\n    A --&gt; B[pCTR 预估]\n    A --&gt; C[相关性质量分]\n    A --&gt; D[出价]\n    B --&gt; E[质量加权出价 rank]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[广告位分配与挤压约束]\n    F --&gt; G[与自然结果混排]\n    G --&gt; H[最终列表]</pre><h2 id=\"骨架约束-广告密度的上限\">骨架约束：广告密度的上限</h2><p>广告混排必须有<strong>硬性的骨架约束（skeleton constraint）</strong>，否则竞价系统会把头部填满。要约束的量有三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首位是否允许广告</td>\n<td>通常不允许</td>\n<td>保护用户的搜索质量校准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告占比上限</td>\n<td>前 10 位不超过 3 个</td>\n<td>保持自然结果主导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小间距</td>\n<td>任意两个广告间隔 ≥ 2 个自然结果</td>\n<td>避免连续广告造成「广告页」观感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目广告上限</td>\n<td>同商家不超过 2 个</td>\n<td>反垄断与体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话内广告上限</td>\n<td>同一会话不超过 N 次</td>\n<td>避免短时间高频曝光</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些数字不是行业标准，需要用<strong>用户侧指标</strong>标定：观测不同广告密度下的「会话内搜索次数」「次会话回访率」「自然结果点击率」。经验规律是广告密度增加会让短期收入上升、自然点击率下降，后者在几天后反映为搜索使用量下降。因此标定的目标不是「收入最大化」，而是「收入与自然点击率的乘积最大化」这类复合目标。</p>\n<p>骨架约束的实现位置很重要：它必须在<strong>分配阶段</strong>强制执行，而不是生成后再过滤。生成后再过滤会导致「过滤掉一个广告后该位置空着」或者「需要递归重排」的复杂度。正确做法是先算出广告位的<strong>允许位置集合</strong>（由骨架约束决定），再在这个集合内做分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pctr-预估与校准\">pCTR 预估与校准</h2><p>广告混排的效果几乎完全取决于 pCTR 的准确性，而 pCTR 预估有两个特有的难题：</p>\n<p><strong>难题一：位置偏差。</strong> 历史广告点击数据只存在于广告实际展示过的位置。如果广告只在第 5 位展示过，那么学到的 pCTR 是「第 5 位的 pCTR」。直接用它去评估「把广告放第 2 位」会低估。标准处理是在训练时引入位置作为特征或做逆倾向加权（inverse propensity weighting），在推理时用「假设位置 = 目标位置」求值。这与 <a href=\"../personalization/personalized-rerank\">在通用排序上的个性化重排</a> 里提到的是同一个统计问题，但广告场景更严重，因为广告位置变化更频繁。</p>\n<p><strong>难题二：校准而非排序。</strong> 广告定价需要绝对概率值（因为要算 eCPM），而模型通常只擅长相对排序。因此 pCTR 输出必须经过<strong>校准</strong>，常用的手段是保序回归（isotonic regression）或 Platt 缩放，用一个留出集把模型输出映射到真实概率。校准的目标可以用<strong>校准误差</strong>衡量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ECE</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mtext>acc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>conf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ECE} = \\sum_{b=1}^{B} \\frac{n_b}{N} \\Big| \\text{acc}(b) - \\text{conf}(b) \\Big|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ECE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中把预测概率分到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个桶，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 桶的样本数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>acc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{acc}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该桶的实际点击率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>conf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{conf}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该桶的平均预测概率。ECE 低于约 0.02 通常被认为是可用的校准水平，明显高于这个值说明定价会系统性偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混排算法-位置分配而非列表拼接\">混排算法：位置分配而非列表拼接</h2><p>广告与自然结果的混排本质是<strong>两个有序列表的合并问题</strong>，但合并的规则不是「按分值归并」，因为两者的分值不在同一尺度上。可用的方法有三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定位插入</td>\n<td>广告固定占某些位置</td>\n<td>简单、可控</td>\n<td>与自然结果质量无关，坑位浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值插入</td>\n<td>广告分数超阈值才插入</td>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>阈值难定，随市场漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局重排</td>\n<td>广告与自然统一打分排序</td>\n<td>理论最优</td>\n<td>分数不可比，需要学习融合权重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>挤压式</td>\n<td>广告位固定数，挤压自然结果下移</td>\n<td>兼顾收入与可控性</td>\n<td>需处理尾部结果被挤出列表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐<strong>挤压式</strong>作为主路径。它的机制是：广告位是固定数量（由骨架约束决定），插入后把相应数量的自然结果向下挤，被挤出列表末尾的结果进入「下一页」或直接丢弃。挤压式的好处是结果列表长度稳定、广告数量可控、自然结果只发生位移而不消失（除了尾部）。</p>\n<p>挤压会带来一个必须处理的副作用：<strong>尾部结果被挤出</strong>。如果自然结果只取 Top 60，插入 6 个广告后，原本第 55 到 60 位的商品被挤出。这本身没问题，但要注意长尾商品在多次请求间被挤出的<strong>不稳定</strong>——同一个商品今天在第 58 位（被挤出），明天在第 52 位（可见）。这种不稳定性对商家是负体验，也是为什么自然结果的召回深度应该留有余量（比如实际需要 60 个，就召 80 个，预留出广告挤压的空间）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    N[自然结果 Top 80] --&gt; S[骨架约束: 计算允许广告位]&#10;    A[广告候选 质量加权出价] --&gt; S&#10;    S --&gt; D[位置分配: 贪心最大化总价值]&#10;    D --&gt; I[挤压插入]&#10;    I --&gt; T[截断到 Top 60]&#10;    T --&gt; R[最终列表]\">flowchart TD\n    N[自然结果 Top 80] --&gt; S[骨架约束: 计算允许广告位]\n    A[广告候选 质量加权出价] --&gt; S\n    S --&gt; D[位置分配: 贪心最大化总价值]\n    D --&gt; I[挤压插入]\n    I --&gt; T[截断到 Top 60]\n    T --&gt; R[最终列表]</pre><h2 id=\"相关性护栏-广告不能吃掉搜索信任\">相关性护栏：广告不能吃掉搜索信任</h2><p>广告混排的长期风险是<strong>信任侵蚀</strong>：用户发现搜索结果里靠前的都是广告，会降低对搜索的依赖，转而直接进店铺或比价站。这个风险必须用显式护栏管理，而不是靠「运营有分寸」。</p>\n<p>可用的护栏有三条：</p>\n<p><strong>护栏一：广告的相关性下限。</strong> 每条广告必须满足「与查询的相关性超过某阈值」才能进入候选。这个阈值应该由「广告商品与自然结果的类目一致性」和「标题与查询的词项覆盖」共同决定。低于阈值的广告即使出价极高也不得展示——这是硬门槛，不参与竞价。</p>\n<p><strong>护栏二：广告的转化质量门槛。</strong> 长期只有点击没有转化的广告会损伤信任。可以对每个广告主维护一个<strong>长期转化健康度</strong>（比如近 30 天广告商品的转化率），低于门槛的降低其质量分权重或暂停竞价资格。</p>\n<p><strong>护栏三：自然结果的可达性。</strong> 保证用户在不点击广告的情况下，仍能在同一屏或下一屏找到高质量的自然结果。具体做法是监控「首位自然结果的点击率」——如果它随广告密度增加而下降，说明广告在拦截用户，需要收紧骨架。</p>\n<p>护栏的效果度量必须<strong>以自然结果侧为主</strong>，而不是只看广告收入。通常的指标组合是：广告收入、自然结果点击率、会话内搜索次数、次会话回访率。四个指标里，后两个是长期健康度指标，它们的下降是信任侵蚀的先行信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"国际化场景的额外约束\">国际化场景的额外约束</h2><p>跨境场景的广告混排还要处理三件事：</p>\n<p><strong>本地广告库存差异。</strong> 新市场可能几乎没有广告主，此时骨架约束设定的广告位无法填满。系统必须优雅降级：填不满广告位时用自然结果回填，而不是留下空位。这要求广告位分配与自然结果插入是同一次重排，而不是两个独立步骤。</p>\n<p><strong>合规差异。</strong> 广告标注（&quot;Ad&quot; / &quot;Sponsored&quot; 标签）在不同市场有不同要求，部分地区要求标注赞助方名称与可追溯链接。标签必须在结果生成时就带在数据里，而不是由前端拼接——因为多端（Web、App、小程序）的标签渲染都要一致。</p>\n<p><strong>跨市场的竞价统一。</strong> 如果多个市场共用一套竞价系统，需要处理货币与出价的统一折算，以及不同市场的 pCTR 模型是否共享。共享模型在数据充足的市场表现更好，但新市场的数据稀疏会拖累整体，因此更稳的做法是<strong>共享模型骨架 + 本地 pCTR 校准</strong>。</p>\n<p>与 <a href=\"../global-effectiveness/per-market-merchandising\">导购规则按市场差异化</a> 的关系是：那里处理的是运营规则的市场差异，这里处理的是<strong>竞价与质量门槛</strong>的市场差异。两者都需要「按市场配置」的能力，但配置的语义不同——规则是运营的意图，竞价门槛是风控与体验的底线，后者的修改权限应该更集中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>广告混排的排序目标是质量加权出价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bid</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>pCTR</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup><mtext>quality</mtext><mi>κ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bid} \\times \\text{pCTR} \\times \\text{quality}^{\\kappa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pCTR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9432em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quality</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7487em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">κ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 决定偏向相关性还是收入的力度。</li>\n<li>骨架约束（首位禁广告、占比上限、最小间距、类目上限）必须在分配阶段强制，而不是生成后过滤。</li>\n<li>pCTR 需要位置偏差校正（训练时）与概率校准（推理时，用 ECE 衡量，目标低于约 0.02）。</li>\n<li>混排推荐<strong>挤压式</strong>：广告位数量固定，插入后挤压自然结果下移；召回深度要留余量以避免尾部商品在请求间抖动。</li>\n<li>护栏三条：广告相关性下限（硬门槛不参与竞价）、广告主长期转化健康度、自然结果可达性。</li>\n<li>效果度量以自然结果侧与长期指标为主：自然点击率、会话内搜索次数、次会话回访率，而非只看广告收入。</li>\n<li>跨境场景需处理广告库存稀疏时的自然回填、地区差异化的广告标注、以及「共享模型骨架 + 本地 pCTR 校准」。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"广告与赞助商品和自然结果的混排","id":"广告与赞助商品和自然结果的混排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：广告位的经济学约束","id":"核心概念-广告位的经济学约束"},{"level":2,"text":"骨架约束：广告密度的上限","id":"骨架约束-广告密度的上限"},{"level":2,"text":"pCTR 预估与校准","id":"pctr-预估与校准"},{"level":2,"text":"混排算法：位置分配而非列表拼接","id":"混排算法-位置分配而非列表拼接"},{"level":2,"text":"相关性护栏：广告不能吃掉搜索信任","id":"相关性护栏-广告不能吃掉搜索信任"},{"level":2,"text":"国际化场景的额外约束","id":"国际化场景的额外约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"活动坑位与商品注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/campaign-injection/campaign-slots"},"next":{"title":"活动商品的库存与可售感知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/campaign-injection/inventory-aware"}}